					"reach": "C-20 (two long tentacles have Reach C-30)",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 18
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Tentacle Grapple (28): The tentacles are not very strong relative to the entire body, but the kraken has many of them. Wrestling at DX+2 gives the kraken a ST score of 82 for the purpose of grappling. The kraken has Constriction Attack. Effective skill 28 includes a +14 bonus for using 8 tentacles at once, Reach C-20 (two long tentacles have Reach C-30)."
				},
